  "description": "Choi Ko-un, who loves his girlfriend so much he feels like he could die, and Han Song, who feels a bit shy about her overly affectionate boyfriend but still enjoys his love, are a happy couple. Their only worry is a small one: \"What costume should we try tomorrow?\" Today, they had another sweet and passionate time together. But suddenly, Han Song starts to feel bothered by thoughts of her ex-boyfriend and the opinions of people around her. She begins to wonder, \"Will Ko-un ever change too...?\" and starts feeling a little worried.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/costume), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/costume_), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000074940), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=250922) \n\n**Official Translations:**    \n[Japanese](https://www.lezhin.jp/ja/comic/costume)",
